# ============================================================
# .gitignore for pelvic-radiomics-grade2-leukopenia
# ============================================================
# This repository contains de-identified summary data and analysis
# code only. The following rules PREVENT accidental upload of
# protected health information (PHI) or any individual-level data.
# ============================================================

# --- Python ---
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*$py.class
*.so
.Python
*.egg-info/
.pytest_cache/
.mypy_cache/
.coverage
htmlcov/
.tox/
.venv/
venv/
env/

# --- Node.js ---
node_modules/
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
package-lock.json
yarn.lock
.npm/

# --- R ---
.Rhistory
.RData
.Rapp.history
.Ruserdata
.Rproj.user/
.Renviron

# --- IDEs / Editors ---
.idea/
.vscode/
*.swp
*.swo
*~
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# --- OS ---
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini

# ============================================================
# PHI DEFENSE (CRITICAL — do not remove these rules)
# ============================================================
# These patterns are designed to FAIL the git add command if
# any individual-level patient file is mistakenly placed here.

# Block any file with "patient" in the name (case-insensitive)
**/patient*.csv
**/patient*.xlsx
**/patient*.json
**/patient*.tsv
**/Patient*.csv
**/Patient*.xlsx
**/Patient*.json

# Block any "merged" or "baseline" data files (these contain patient names as keys)
**/merged*.csv
**/merged*.xlsx
**/merged*.json
**/baseline*.csv
**/baseline*.xlsx
**/baseline*.json

# Block raw input data files
**/input_data*.json
**/data_with_patient_id*
**/name_mapping*
**/patient_name*

# Block raw DICOM and dose files
**/*.dcm
**/*.DCM
**/dose*.dcm
**/rtplan*
**/rtstruct*
**/rtdose*

# Block any file that might contain names (Chinese name patterns)
**/*姓名*
**/*住院号*
**/*身份证*

# Block any workbuddy / memory files (work logs may contain PHI)
.workbuddy/
*.workbuddy*

# Block any "Results manuscript" draft (may mention excluded patients by name)
*Results_文字稿*
*IRB_申报*

# Block any intermediate or backup files
**/*.bak
**/*.tmp
**/*.swp
**/*_DEID.bak
**/backup/

# Block the helper script used to de-identify (it contains the name→PID map)
_deid_helper.py
_deid_*.py

# ============================================================
# Allowed exceptions (these files ARE in the repo, do not block)
# ============================================================
# !data/nomogram_params.json
# !data/roc_curves.json
# !data/model_comparison*.json
# !data/nri_idi*.json
# !data/ambiguous_resolved.json
# !data/dosi_group_comparison*.csv
# (All other .json/.csv files in data/ are explicitly listed as
# allowed; the broad "**/*.json" rule below does NOT block these
# because the PHI-defense patterns above are more specific and
# these files don't match them.)
